Package: checkclaude
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libayatana-appindicator3-1, xdg-utils, curl
Maintainer: zzusec <hzsinno@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/zzusec/CheckClaude
Description: Claude runtime environment checker
 CheckClaude scores 26 network and system signals to tell you whether this
 machine's exit IP, timezone, locale, DNS and browser fingerprint are
 consistent enough to run Claude without being flagged.
 .
 Ships a CLI (checkclaude) and a GTK tray indicator (checkclaude-tray).
